 <div class="zoom-toolbar"><b>檢視縮放</b><button class="ghost-btn" id="iaZoomOut">−</button><button class="ghost-btn" id="iaFit">適合畫面</button><button class="ghost-btn" id="iaActual">100%</button><button class="ghost-btn" id="iaZoomIn">＋</button><span id="iaZoomLabel">100%</span><span class="hint">只影響畫面大小，不會降低輸出解析度。</span></div>
